  "description": "Uniconta Connector for DynamicWeb 10 and 9\n\nIntegrate Uniconta ERP seamlessly with DynamicWeb and automate your entire business flow between webshop and ERP. The connector synchronizes key data sets from Uniconta to DynamicWeb, including products, BOMs, price matrices, stock levels, customers, user accounts, addresses, currencies, payment terms, brands and shipping information. Multiple warehouse locations are also supported.\n\nThe connector includes preconfigured integration flows that work out of the box, while also allowing customization to match your specific needs. You can control which fields to import, how frequently data is updated, and how orders are sent back to Uniconta.\n\nData flows bidirectionally where relevant: orders and deliveries are transferred from DynamicWeb back into Uniconta, ensuring consistent processing and accurate financial and logistical records. In addition, the DynamicWeb Customer Center receives order history, invoices and account data directly from Uniconta, providing customers with full self-service insights.\n\nDeveloped for DynamicWeb 10.x and DynamicWeb 9.1x.x – contact Flex Media for details. Requires Uniconta API access and an active Flex Media license.\n\nIncludes comprehensive documentation and setup guide.\n\nRead more and get started: https://www.flex-media.dk/erp-integration/dynamicweb-uniconta-integration\n\nSupport: support@flexmedia.dk | +45 4817 6666 / +45 4422 8430",
